Attention Power and Natural Gas traders:
IntercontinentalExchange is excited to announce the launch of two new produ=
cts that settle against our daily indices.

On Friday, October 5 IntercontinentalExchange will launch financial swaps s=
ettling against our Power and Natural Gas indices.  These two new products,=
 1.) NG Fin Sw Swap, FP for ICE and 2.) Fin Swap-Peak, FP for ICE, will be =
listed for the Henry Hub in Natural Gas and for Cinergy and PJM-West in Pow=
er.  All new markets will have to be manually added to portfolios.

Please contact our 24 hour Help Desk with any questions- 770 738 2101.








