ear anyway.  Terry Allen , RB BAL - The Replacements Updated 12/18/01 The R=
avens are likely to feature one running back Sunday against Cincinnati afte=
r Allen, Moe Williams and Obafemi Ayanbadejo combined for just 10 carries f=
