X-From: Paul Y'Barbo
X-To: Clay Harris <Clay Harris/ENRON_DEVELOPMENT@ENRON_DEVELOPMENT>, Dan Masters <Dan Masters/HOU/ECT@ECT>, Wayne Perry <Wayne Perry/ENRON_DEVELOPMENT@ENRON_DEVELOPMENT>
X-cc: 
