				calendar day of the same month		April 4-April 30

24 hour grid			Linear expresssion of the day		0100, 0200, 0300............2200, 2300,2400	

Peak (Heavy Load Hours)	The heavy use time of the day		HE 0700- HE 2200, PST

HE				Hour Ending				For the hour of 6: 00 am to 7:00 am is HE7

Off Peak (Light Load Hours)	The lower use time of the day		MTWTFS= HE 1-6 AND 23-24,   Sun = 1-24, Holidays = 1-24.

