 Last Friday morning, Jude called me to say hello - one last time. =20
=20
My friend was a kind and considerate man with a gentle heart.  The irony of=
 his life is that he and his family fled Lebanon in the eighties to escape =
the war there. =20
=20
Jude's world is now a world of eternal love and peace.  And his spirit will=
 be kept alive by the memories that his family and friends share with each =
other, and with those of you who didn't have the joy of knowing him persona=
lly.
