 Monday, July 9, 2001  BY JIM PUZZANGHERA   Mercury News Washington Bureau =
   WASHINGTON -- California officials and power suppliers failed to agree o=
n refunds for electricity overcharges as 15 days of contentious negotiation=
s ended Monday, leaving the matter in the hands of a federal judge who said=
